public.prompt:
Read each saved-settings excerpt and decide whether it meets ALL approved criteria below. The threshold value is a percent of the budget amount. A valid result has matching scope, amount and period, exactly one matching notification (threshold value, actual or forecast basis, and approved recipient), and no resource-stopping actions.
Approved criteria:
```json
{
  "budget": {
    "budget_id": "sandbox-cost-budget",
    "scope": "sandbox workload",
    "amount": 1000,
    "period": "monthly"
  },
  "notifications": [
    {
      "notification_id": "sandbox-cost-alert",
      "threshold_value": 80,
      "threshold_basis": "actual",
      "recipient": "budget-owner@example.invalid"
    }
  ],
  "resource_stopping_actions_configured": false
}
```
